Modifications
-------------

Changes made in this fork relative to upstream Teable are limited to product
branding and visual theming, including:

  * Replacement of the product name and logo mark with "BomaSheet".
  * A revised colour palette and theme tokens.
  * Regenerated favicons, PWA icons, and email template styling.
  * Documentation describing the fork and its licensing obligations.

